37-- Delivery state: per-user per-campaign `status` (eligible/shown/clicked/dismissed), `timestamps`.
38-- Survey: `id`, `type` (NPS/CSAT/CES/custom), `questions` (branching optional), `audience`, `frequency cap`, `start/end`, `cta`.
